{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"kralik-na-vine-stuffat-tal-fenek","title":"Králík na víně po maltsku","description":"Maltský králičí guláš s rajčaty, vínem, česnekem a bramborami.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":6,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":25,"cookMinutes":180,"category":"Hlavní jídla","tags":["Králík","Maltská kuchyně","Dušené"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"kralik","name":"králík","quantity":{"kind":"range","min":1.5,"max":2},"unit":"kg","note":"naporcovaný"},{"id":"vino","name":"červené víno","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":350},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"bobkovy-list","name":"bobkové listy","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":6},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"cesnek","name":"stroužky česneku","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":6},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"olej","name":"olivový olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":80},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"cibule","name":"cibule","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"protlak","name":"rajčatový protlak","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":60},"unit":"ml","approximate":true},{"id":"rajcata","name":"rajčatové pyré","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1500},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"voda","name":"voda","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":250},"unit":"ml"},{"id":"brambory","name":"brambory","quantity":{"kind":"range","min":3,"max":4},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"dochuceni","name":"sůl a pepř","quantity":{"kind":"text","text":"podle chuti"}}]}],"steps":["Králíka přes noc naložte do vína s polovinou bobkových listů a celými stroužky česneku.","Maso osušte a na oleji opečte. Přidejte cibuli, nasekaný česnek a protlak, krátce orestujte.","Přilijte marinádu, rajčatové pyré a vodu, přidejte zbylé bobkové listy a zvolna duste asi 3 hodiny. Brambory přidejte tak, aby se uvařily doměkka v omáčce."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.sbs.com.au/food/recipe/rabbit-stew-stuffat-tal-fenek/dptduac47","author":"Paul Camilleri · SBS Food","importedAt":"2026-09-19"}],"provenance":{"kind":"facts"}}
